# THE COME-ROUND (shared keeper rule, 2026-09-27): a keeper whose target keeps
# to its flank inside its reach for a whole turn-pause comes round on it with a
# short-told sweep at that side, in its own flavour (SentinelDef.come_round).
# The salt flats' rake, brought to its guarded second phase (it turns slower than
# a player walks round it), the player standing at its working side and waiting:
# it drags itself round and the sweep's tell hangs over that side. (The Coast's
# reaper turns on the spot in its second phase and never needs to.)
#
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/come_round.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --held=axe_felling --config=unharmed
coast calm
place salt_flats
near keeper
wait 0.6
await sentinel 12
wound sentinel.salt 0.5
wait 0.4
try 6
  walkto part 3
  await came_round 6
end
shot 01-it-comes-round-on-its-flank with mob:sentinel.salt
